{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L7sgsNkqykXXGSGGhoYoKc","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect. I have all the information you need. Here's the complete report:\n\n## pkg/sys Package - Stat Function and FileInfo Struct\n\n### Function Signatures\n\n**Stat() function:**\n```go\nfunc Stat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\n```\n- Returns extended file metadata for the specified path, following symbolic links\n- Implementation delegates to `os.Stat()` and populates FileInfo from syscall.Stat_t\n\n**Lstat() function:**\n```go\nfunc Lstat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\n```\n- Returns extended file metadata for the specified path without following symbolic links\n- Implementation delegates to `os.Lstat()` and populates FileInfo from syscall.Stat_t\n\n### FileInfo Struct Definition\n\n```go\ntype FileInfo struct {\n\tMode       os.FileMode\n\tSize       int64\n\tNlink      uint64\n\tUid        uint32\n\tGid        uint32\n\tRdev       uint64\n\tDev        uint64\n\tIno        uint64\n\tBlocks     int64\n\tBlksize    int64\n\tModTime    time.Time\n\tAccessTime time.Time\n\tChangeTime time.Time\n\tInfo       os.FileInfo\n}\n```\n\n**Key time fields:**\n- `ModTime`: Modification time (populated from Darwin's `st_mtimespec`)\n- `AccessTime`: Access time (populated from Darwin's `st_atimespec`)\n- `ChangeTime`: Change time/inode change time (populated from Darwin's `st_ctimespec`)\n\n### How to Import and Use\n\n**Import:**\n```go\nimport \"go-unix-utils/pkg/sys\"\n```\n\n**Usage example:**\n```go\n// Follow symlinks\ninfo, err := sys.Stat(\"/path/to/file\")\nif err != nil {\n\t// handle error\n}\naccessTime := info.AccessTime\nmodTime := info.ModTime\n\n// Don't follow symlinks\ninfo, err := sys.Lstat(\"/path/to/file\")\nif err != nil {\n\t// handle error\n}\n```\n\n**File location:**\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5431/pkg/sys/fileinfo.go` - Contains Stat(), Lstat(), and FileInfo struct\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5431/pkg/sys/stat_darwin.go` - Contains Darwin-specific implementation details"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31c12309-51d3-4723-8331-36ed2107f1db","uuid":"077cef25-d2ea-4f36-b13a-ce144334211f","timestamp":"2026-05-21T18:17:58.295Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5431, find the pkg/sys package's Stat function and FileInfo struct. I need to know:\n1. The exact signature of Stat() and Lstat()\n2. The FileInfo struct fields (especially AccessTime, ModTime)\n3. How to import and use them\n\nSearch in pkg/sys/ directory. Report the exact function signatures and struct definition.","agentId":"a8f4d791c14b5c0a0","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect. I have all the information you need. Here's the complete report:\n\n## pkg/sys Package - Stat Function and FileInfo Struct\n\n### Function Signatures\n\n**Stat() function:**\n```go\nfunc Stat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\n```\n- Returns extended file metadata for the specified path, following symbolic links\n- Implementation delegates to `os.Stat()` and populates FileInfo from syscall.Stat_t\n\n**Lstat() function:**\n```go\nfunc Lstat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\n```\n- Returns extended file metadata for the specified path without following symbolic links\n- Implementation delegates to `os.Lstat()` and populates FileInfo from syscall.Stat_t\n\n### FileInfo Struct Definition\n\n```go\ntype FileInfo struct {\n\tMode       os.FileMode\n\tSize       int64\n\tNlink      uint64\n\tUid        uint32\n\tGid        uint32\n\tRdev       uint64\n\tDev        uint64\n\tIno        uint64\n\tBlocks     int64\n\tBlksize    int64\n\tModTime    time.Time\n\tAccessTime time.Time\n\tChangeTime time.Time\n\tInfo       os.FileInfo\n}\n```\n\n**Key time fields:**\n- `ModTime`: Modification time (populated from Darwin's `st_mtimespec`)\n- `AccessTime`: Access time (populated from Darwin's `st_atimespec`)\n- `ChangeTime`: Change time/inode change time (populated from Darwin's `st_ctimespec`)\n\n### How to Import and Use\n\n**Import:**\n```go\nimport \"go-unix-utils/pkg/sys\"\n```\n\n**Usage example:**\n```go\n// Follow symlinks\ninfo, err := sys.Stat(\"/path/to/file\")\nif err != nil {\n\t// handle error\n}\naccessTime := info.AccessTime\nmodTime := info.ModTime\n\n// Don't follow symlinks\ninfo, err := sys.Lstat(\"/path/to/file\")\nif err != nil {\n\t// handle error\n}\n```\n\n**File location:**\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5431/pkg/sys/fileinfo.go` - Contains Stat(), Lstat(), and FileInfo struct\n- `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5431/pkg/sys/stat_darwin.go` - Contains Darwin-specific implementation details"}],"totalDurationMs":12021,"totalTokens":20134,"totalToolUseCount":5,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":187,"cache_read_input_tokens":19306,"output_tokens":635,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":187},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":19306,"cache_creation_input_tokens":187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":187,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":2,"searchCount":1,"bashCount":2,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
